lg:NO-EHL-s11-1-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "7400c4c5699ddee7677041ac34df4cc36c869b94176d15a87176b27e6541b229" ;
    lgo:text """Before electronic ordering the service provider must, in a clear, comprehensible and unambiguous manner, inform the service recipient of:
a. relevant codes of conduct that the service provider follows and whether and where they are available electronically,
b. the different technical stages connected with concluding the agreement,
c. whether a concluded agreement will be archived by the service provider and whether it will be accessible,
d. the technical means for identifying and correcting input errors before the order is placed,
e. the languages in which the agreement can be concluded."""@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "SWE-2" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-02"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:NO-EHL-s11-1-q1 .

lg:NO-EHL-s11-2-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "154bec35efefb07e08a4e3e1eb346ea6d8bb849a0c767a1a9302aa35f8a6d4c3" ;
    lgo:text "Contractual terms, standard terms and general terms must be made available to the service recipient in a manner that makes it possible to store and reproduce them. The service provider must arrange the electronic conclusion of contracts so that input errors can easily be detected and corrected before the agreement is concluded."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "SWE-2" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-02"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:NO-EHL-s11-2-q1 .

lg:NO-EHL-s11-3-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "e2d3d417ee043c39a9bc5bc59537c3a8ee8193b7452a9f875118cc26bea01ea9" ;
    lgo:text "The first and third paragraphs do not apply to agreements concluded exclusively by electronic mail or equivalent individual communication, and may be departed from in agreements outside consumer relations."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "SWE-2" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-02"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:NO-EHL-s11-3-q1 .

lg:NO-EHL-s8-1-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "c366cf5fc1b51cd168680fdc77843fa8999ec360c627392800bfab6251538982" ;
    lgo:text """A service provider must, in carrying on its business, always provide information about its name, address, email address and other particulars that make it possible to contact the service provider directly. The service provider must also state:
a. the enterprise register in which the service provider is registered, as well as the service provider's organisation number and whether the business is subject to value-added tax, and
b. any authorisations required to carry on the business and the name and address of the relevant authorising authority."""@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "SWE-2" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-02"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:NO-EHL-s8-1-q1 .

lg:NO-EHL-s8-2-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "144de01f2a000a8debb986dd3d189d5b31b2ba90c58efb076ac391c3f9d4032b" ;
    lgo:text """In the case of professional activity that directly or indirectly under law or regulation requires the person to hold a diploma or certificate of education, the service provider must also state:
a. its professional title and in which member state it was conferred,
b. which rules of professional conduct apply to the service provider, and
c. where the service recipient can access the rules mentioned in letter b."""@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "SWE-2" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-02"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:NO-EHL-s8-2-q1 .

lg:NO-EHL-s8-3-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "2e48fde671ef62d25aca43159e81653d7ecd41cdb95852094cd67cf1f738330b" ;
    lgo:text "The information under the first and second paragraphs must be made easily and directly accessible to service recipients and public authorities. The provision does not apply to service providers that only offer services consisting of transmitting information over an electronic communications network."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "SWE-2" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-02"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:NO-EHL-s8-3-q1 .

lg:NO-FREG-s7-2-1-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "8bc537e89a607f2fcce8f4640bbcc0264973b1476810167fcc000b54508bd036" ;
    lgo:text "(1) An enterprise's websites, letters and business documents shall, irrespective of the medium on which they appear, contain the enterprise's organisation number and business name or name. For enterprises registered in the VAT Register, sales documents shall in addition contain the letters MVA placed after the organisation number."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "SWE-2 (Devin)" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-12"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:NO-FREG-s7-2-1-q1 .

lg:NO-FREG-s7-2-2-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "4588ebef9ed5f0db14f08ed20569bd5917435234f2bd428707f4b39047dd2f27" ;
    lgo:text "(2) The websites, letters and business documents of a private limited company and a public limited company shall, irrespective of the medium on which they appear, in addition state the register in which the company is registered, the organisational form, the head office and, where applicable, that the company is in liquidation."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "SWE-2 (Devin)" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-12"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:NO-FREG-s7-2-2-q1 .

lg:NO-FREG-s7-2-3-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "a7dc7d9d2d5ed294edd9699f5f44b0ef0a938e14507206d49ec8eb5b8332b10a" ;
    lgo:text "(3) For a branch of a foreign enterprise, cf. section 3-8, the branch's letters, announcements and other documents shall in addition state the register in which the branch is registered. The foreign enterprise shall also provide the information mentioned in the second paragraph."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "SWE-2 (Devin)" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-12"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:NO-FREG-s7-2-3-q1 .

lg:NO-FREG-s7-2-4-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "1573927597332ced9c9b1376587b66d31dd0365aecd60a7b038186093e2ccb13" ;
    lgo:text "(4) For a European economic interest grouping, the enterprise's documents shall contain the information mentioned in Regulation (EEC) No 2137/85 Article 25, cf. the EEIG Act section 1."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "SWE-2 (Devin)" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-12"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:NO-FREG-s7-2-4-q1 .

lg:NO-FREG-title-15f8038860e9-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "15f8038860e91fcc1998398bf1acbb5a502cc153b352b37fdb44a05e8ff57787" ;
    lgo:text "Act relating to the Register of Business Enterprises (Foretaksregisterloven)"@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "SWE-2 (Devin)" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-12"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translatedProperty eli:title ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:NO-FREG .

lg:NO-MEDIE-s5-1-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "09ee116974b4f09cdf0a151fb6c93a96d5b196b5bc99225821d40778b5f4c711" ;
    lgo:text "The editor shall ensure that it is stated in the medium who the editor is."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "Devin (SWE-2)" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-13"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:NO-MEDIE-s5-1-q1 .

lg:NO-MEDIE-s5-2-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "2a5149cd4a1bd9b649194c596dc3b9e8eec7a16543a32a495a5dade4ea8e4616" ;
    lgo:text "The editor shall ensure that media users have access to the name, address, email address and other information that makes it possible to contact the medium directly."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "Devin (SWE-2)" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-13"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:NO-MEDIE-s5-2-q1 .

lg:NO-MEDIE-title-0c52edc711f8-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "0c52edc711f860e76e1c0868055869f892635878ab1f582e68bdfa2e24988679" ;
    lgo:text "Act on editorial independence and responsibility in editor-controlled journalistic media (the Media Liability Act)"@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "Devin (SWE-2)" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-13"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translatedProperty eli:title ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:NO-MEDIE .

lg:NO-MFL-s10a-1-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "537e5ea7644db850e5d018bbc58c849c1569265705953e71650c60f4a9818398" ;
    lgo:text "Traders shall, in a clear and understandable manner, provide consumers with information about complaint bodies that can handle a case between the parties and that are registered pursuant to the Approval Act section 25. The information shall refer to the complaint bodies' websites on the internet. The information shall as a minimum be given in the general contract terms, where such exist, and on the trader's website on the internet, where such exists. The information shall be easily accessible on the website."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "swe-2-high" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-13"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:NO-MFL-s10a-1-q1 .

lg:NO-MFL-s10a-2-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "341162a334a4c310eb9dc165dde2568e54005f7a98742ae5c6602f6da87616dd" ;
    lgo:text "Traders shall inform the consumer pursuant to the first paragraph when a case arises between the parties and it is clear that the parties will not reach an amicable settlement themselves. The information shall be given in writing or on another durable medium."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "swe-2-high" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-13"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:NO-MFL-s10a-2-q1 .

lg:NO-MFL-s10a-3-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "b88deb6965570902da3129787aa81ac78e5f38fa90dcd31bc62728835f4e6b99" ;
    lgo:text "By durable medium is meant any device that enables consumers to store information in such a way that it is accessible in the future in unaltered form."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "swe-2-high" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-13"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:NO-MFL-s10a-3-q1 .

lg:NO-MFL-title-ef95d355bb6a-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "ef95d355bb6a213e38156be474a8c88bd05f256afc762c938ce09d574becae66" ;
    lgo:text "Act on control of marketing and contract terms, etc. (the Marketing Act)"@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "swe-2-high" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-13"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translatedProperty eli:title ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
